The guard is part of `verify:product`.

**Status DG-6.6 (2026-07-31):** fixtures and capability proofs are distinctly,
machine-readably ratcheted without adding a parallel role field to the manifest.

### DG-6.7 slice — wire ratchets into standard guard bundles

**Audit:** adding leaf scripts to `verify:product` did not guarantee execution in
the common Phase G/H fast-track, which calls `guard:guest-plugin-conformance`,
or in the grouped workspace guard family.

The clone ratchet is now a named guest-conformance step, and the workspace-role
ratchet is a leaf in `guard:workspace`. Direct package scripts remain available
