The initial DG clone/role specs only proved that the current repository passes.
They did not prove that the guards reject the regressions they claim to block.

Both guards now accept a test-only workspace-root override. Negative subprocess
fixtures verify that a Harbor `catalog.service.ts` parallel stem fails the clone
guard and that marking finance-ws5 `productionTier: certified` fails the role
guard. Temporary fixture trees are isolated and removed after each test.

**Status DG-6.10 (2026-07-31):** both DG ratchets have positive and adversarial
contract coverage.

